gonna try to get back soon.

517
00:25:45.074 --> 00:25:46.473
Anything else?

518
00:25:46.957 --> 00:25:48.042
<i>Uh. no.</i>

519
00:25:48.457 --> 00:25:49.243
Great.

520
00:25:49.345 --> 00:25:50.577
[receiver clatters]

521
00:25:50.719 --> 00:25:52.753
[dial tone]

522
00:25:54.249 --> 00:25:56.249
