- You couldn't take them?

576
00:28:21.182 --> 00:28:22.904
You could have waited till he was alone.

577
00:28:22.929 --> 00:28:25.130
<i>Dije</i> no families.

578
00:28:26.236 --> 00:28:27.285
He's a<i> pinche maricón.</i>

579
