581
00:28:33.904 --> 00:28:35.503
Or maybe I should just go to my father.

582
00:28:36.185 --> 00:28:38.029
Tell him you killed Max.

583
00:28:38.208 --> 00:28:39.896
Okay.

584
00:28:40.154 --> 00:28:42.086
