625
00:30:54.494 --> 00:30:56.960
He'll be okay.

626
00:31:06.216 --> 00:31:08.003
You should go. Teddy.

627
00:31:08.182 --> 00:31:11.617
No. that's okay. Uh. hey. you hungry?

628
00:31:12.109 --> 00:31:13.842
There's this great Mexican place.

629
