749
00:42:59.805 --> 00:43:01.158
[Cissy laughs]

750
00:43:21.767 --> 00:43:23.416
[Cissy laughs]

751
00:43:41.136 --> 00:43:42.721
[Cissy laughs]

752
00:43:46.682 --> 00:43:47.627
CISSY: Ah!

753
00:44:04.874 --> 00:44:06.299
