771
00:45:01.630 --> 00:45:03.463
<i>PHILLIP: Jumped off the balcony.</i>

772
00:45:03.488 --> 00:45:05.408
<i>ARNOLD: What'chu talkin' about. Dad?</i>

773
00:45:05.456 --> 00:45:10.559
